---
import Container from '@/components/Container.astro';
---

<section id="pflicht" class="py-14 md:py-20 lg:py-24 bg-[#F7F5EF]" aria-labelledby="duty-heading" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:ibrz2t">
  <Container>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_1fr] gap-10 lg:gap-14 items-start" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:v28pa6">

      {/* Erklärtext */}
      <div data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:v28pa7">
        <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[13px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.08em] uppercase text-[#2F6870] mb-3" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:we5bs0">
          <span class="w-6 h-[3px] rounded-full bg-[#C99A63]" aria-hidden="true" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:3tzbms"></span>
          Rechtlicher Rahmen
        </p>
        <h2 id="duty-heading" class="font-heading text-[28px] sm:text-[34px] lg:text-[40px] font-black tracking-tight text-[#123F46] leading-[1.15] mb-5" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:rtha9v">
          Rauchmelderpflicht in Berlin: Das sollten Eigentümer wissen
        </h2>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 text-[15.5px] text-[#1C2D30] leading-relaxed" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:v28pa8">
          <p class="m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:we5brz">
            <strong class="font-extrabold text-[#123F46]">Welche Räume betroffen sind:</strong> In Berlin schreibt § 48 der Bauordnung (BauO Bln) Rauchwarnmelder für Schlafräume und Kinderzimmer vor sowie für Flure, über die Rettungswege führen. Die Pflicht gilt für Neubau und Bestand gleichermaßen.
          </p>
          <p class="m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:we5bry">
            <strong class="font-extrabold text-[#123F46]">Wer für den Einbau verantwortlich ist:</strong> Die Ausstattung der Wohnung mit Rauchwarnmeldern liegt grundsätzlich bei den Eigentümerinnen und Eigentümern. Wer eine Wohnung vermietet, sollte die Pflicht also nicht den Mietern überlassen.
          </p>
          <p class="m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:we5brx">
            <strong class="font-extrabold text-[#123F46]">Wer die Betriebsbereitschaft sichert:</strong> Wartung und Funktionsfähigkeit können im Einzelfall unterschiedlich geregelt sein, etwa zwischen Eigentümer, Bewohner oder beauftragtem Dienstleister. In der Praxis delegieren die meisten Vermieter und Verwaltungen das an einen Fachbetrieb, weil dann Prüfung und Nachweis aus einer Hand kommen.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-[#DCE4DF] bg-white px-5 py-4" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:v28pa9">
          <p class="text-[13.5px] text-[#5D6E70] leading-relaxed m-0" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:we5brw">
            Diese Übersicht ist eine allgemeine Einordnung und <strong class="font-bold text-[#123F46]">keine Rechtsberatung</strong>. Maßgeblich ist der aktuelle Gesetzestext: <a href="https://gesetze.berlin.de" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-bold text-[#2F6870] underline decoration-[#67C53A] decoration-2 underline-offset-2 hover:text-[#67C53A]" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:pa7f31">§ 48 Bauordnung für Berlin (BauO Bln) auf gesetze.berlin.de</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white rounded-[22px] border border-[#DCE4DF] p-5 sm:p-7 shadow-[0_12px_35px_rgba(18,63,70,0.08)] lg:sticky lg:top-24" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:v28paa">
        <p class="text-[13px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.06em] uppercase text-[#5D6E70] mb-4 mt-0" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:we5brv">So sieht es in einer typischen Berliner Wohnung aus</p>
        <div class="rf" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:rf01">
          <div class="apt" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:apt01">
            <section class="wohnen" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:wohnen01">
              <div class="win top" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxuh5"></div>
              <div class="rug" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxuh4"></div>
              <div class="sofa" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxuh3"></div>
              <div class="coffee" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxuh2"></div>
              <div class="tv" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxuh1"></div>
              <div class="plant p1" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxuh0"></div>
              <div class="status orange" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxugz"></div>
              <div class="txt" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxugd">Wohnen<small>optional</small></div>
            </section>
            <section class="schlafen" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:schlafen01">
              <div class="win top" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxugc"></div>
              <div class="bed" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxugb"></div>
              <div class="nightstand" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxuga"></div>
              <div class="closet" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxug9"></div>
              <div class="plant p2" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxug8"></div>
              <div class="status green" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxug7"></div>
              <div class="txt" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxug6">Schlafen</div>
            </section>
            <section class="kind" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:kind01">
              <div class="win right" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxug5"></div>
              <div class="kidbed" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxug4"></div>
              <div class="desk" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxufi"></div>
              <div class="shelf" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxufh"></div>
              <div class="status green" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxufg"></div>
              <div class="txt" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxuff">Kind</div>
            </section>
            <section class="flur" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:flur01">
              <div class="console" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxufe"></div>
              <div class="status green" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxufd"></div>
              <div class="txt" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxufc">Flur<small>Rettungsweg</small></div>
            </section>
            <section class="kueche" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:kueche01">
              <div class="win left" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxufb"></div>
              <div class="kline" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxufa"></div>
              <div class="upper" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:tcxuf9"></div>
              <div class="plant p3" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:5j2ij7"></div>
              <div class="status gray" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:5j2ij6"></div>
              <div class="txt" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:5j2ij5">Küche</div>
            </section>
            <section class="bad" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:bad01">
              <div class="win right" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:5j2ij4"></div>
              <div class="shower" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:5j2ij3"></div>
              <div class="sink" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:5j2ij2"></div>
              <div class="wc" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:5j2ij1"></div>
              <div class="status gray" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:5j2ij0"></div>
              <div class="txt" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:5j2iiz">Bad</div>
            </section>
            <div class="entry" data-ps="src/components/home/v2/DutySection.astro:5j2iiy"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>

<style>
.rf,.rf *{box-sizing:border-box}
.rf{--w:#a2a2a2;--g:#08a545;--o:#ffb014;--x:#9b9b9b;width:min(100%,380px);aspect-ratio:536/642;padding:2px;background:#fff;container-type:inline-size;margin:auto}
.apt{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:43fr 26fr 31fr;grid-template-rows:27fr 24fr 49fr;gap:1.75cqw;padding:3.45cqw;background:var(--w)}
.apt section{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#fff;container-type:inline-size}
.wohnen{grid-area:1/1/3/2;background:#fcfbf8}
.schlafen{grid-area:1/2/2/4}
.kind{grid-area:2/3/3/4}
.flur{grid-area:2/2/4/3;background:#f8f8f8}
.kueche{grid-area:3/1/4/2}
.bad{grid-area:3/3/4/4}
.txt{position:absolute;z-index:7;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);color:#111;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;line-height:.94}
.txt small{display:block;margin-top:.22em;font-size:.52em;line-height:1.05}
.wohnen .txt{top:64%;font-size:16cqw}
.schlafen .txt{top:69%;font-size:12.2cqw}
.kind .txt{top:58%;font-size:19cqw}
.flur .txt{top:41%;font-size:26.7cqw}
.flur .txt small{font-size:.48em}
.kueche .txt{top:48%;font-size:15cqw}
.bad .txt{top:48%;font-size:18cqw}
.status{--s:24cqw;position:absolute;z-index:8;left:50%;width:var(--s);aspect-ratio:1;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:calc(var(--s)*.075) solid currentColor}
.green{color:var(--g)}.orange{color:var(--o)}.gray{color:var(--x)}
.wohnen .status{--s:26cqw;top:40%}
.schlafen .status{--s:19cqw;top:27%}
.kind .status{--s:30cqw;top:29%}
.flur .status{--s:41.6cqw;top:29%}
.kueche .status{--s:23cqw;top:31%}
.bad .status{--s:28cqw;top:31%}
.green:after,.orange:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:23%;top:20%;width:47%;height:28%;border-left:calc(var(--s)*.105) solid currentColor;border-bottom:calc(var(--s)*.105) solid currentColor;transform:rotate(-45deg)}
.gray:before,.gray:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:45%;top:17%;width:calc(var(--s)*.095);height:66%;background:currentColor;border-radius:99px}
.gray:before{transform:rotate(45deg)}
.gray:after{transform:rotate(-45deg)}
.win{position:absolute;z-index:3;background:#fff;border:.55cqw solid #888}
.win:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:12%;border-top:.28cqw solid #aaa;border-bottom:.28cqw solid #aaa}
.top{top:-.3cqw;left:28%;width:40%;height:4.5cqw}
.left{left:-.3cqw;top:31%;width:4.5cqw;height:32%}
.right{right:-.3cqw;top:31%;width:4.5cqw;height:32%}
.plant{position:absolute;width:5.5cqw;height:5.5cqw;background:#63a85d;border-radius:55% 55% 40% 40%}
.plant:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:30%;bottom:-2cqw;width:40%;height:2.1cqw;background:#d5b08a}
.p1{left:9%;top:7%}
.p2{right:23%;top:8%}
.p3{left:8%;bottom:18%}
.rug{position:absolute;left:8%;top:18%;width:70%;height:32%;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f3efe8,#faf7f2);border:.45cqw solid #ddd;border-radius:1.5cqw}
.sofa{position:absolute;left:13%;top:8%;width:56%;height:18%;border:.7cqw solid #8f8f8f;border-radius:2.3cqw;background:#fff;z-index:2}
.sofa:before,.sofa:after{content:"";position:absolute;top:-3.2cqw;width:38%;height:5cqw;border:.6cqw solid #8c8c8c;border-radius:1.7cqw;background:#fff}
.sofa:before{left:2%}.sofa:after{right:2%}
.coffee{position:absolute;left:34%;top:29%;width:18%;height:10%;border:.45cqw solid #aaa;border-radius:50%;background:#fff}
.tv{position:absolute;right:10%;top:13%;width:7%;height:30%;background:#f7f7f7;border:.45cqw solid #aaa}
.bed{position:absolute;left:9%;top:9%;width:43%;height:26%;border:.5cqw solid #8f8f8f;background:#fff}
.bed:before,.bed:after{content:"";position:absolute;top:4%;width:40%;height:24%;border:.4cqw solid #aaa;background:#fff}
.bed:before{left:6%}.bed:after{right:6%}
.nightstand{position:absolute;left:54%;top:15%;width:8%;height:11%;background:#f3f3f3;border:.35cqw solid #aaa}
.closet{position:absolute;right:1%;top:0;width:19%;height:57%;border:.4cqw solid #999;background:linear-gradient(65deg,transparent 49%,#aaa 50%,transparent 51%),linear-gradient(-65deg,transparent 49%,#aaa 50%,transparent 51%),#fff}
.kidbed{position:absolute;left:5%;bottom:6%;width:90%;height:16%;border:.7cqw solid #999;background:linear-gradient(12deg,transparent 49%,#aaa 50%,transparent 51%),linear-gradient(-12deg,transparent 49%,#aaa 50%,transparent 51%),#fff}
.desk{position:absolute;left:5%;top:9%;width:36%;height:18%;border:.55cqw solid #999}
.shelf{position:absolute;right:6%;top:10%;width:12%;height:28%;border:.45cqw solid #999;background:linear-gradient(#ddd,#ddd) 0 33%/100% .45cqw no-repeat,linear-gradient(#ddd,#ddd) 0 66%/100% .45cqw no-repeat,#fff}
.console{position:absolute;left:14%;top:8%;width:72%;height:6%;background:#f4f4f4;border:.45cqw solid #aaa}
.upper{position:absolute;left:9%;top:8%;width:28%;height:9%;border:.35cqw solid #b1b1b1}
.kline{position:absolute;left:6%;right:5%;bottom:3%;height:16%;border-top:.45cqw solid #999}
.kline:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:2%;bottom:0;width:24%;height:100%;border:.45cqw solid #999;background:radial-gradient(circle at 27% 30%,transparent 0 3cqw,#999 3.2cqw 3.8cqw,transparent 4cqw),radial-gradient(circle at 73% 72%,transparent 0 3cqw,#999 3.2cqw 3.8cqw,transparent 4cqw),#fff}
.kline:after{content:"";position:absolute;right:2%;bottom:0;width:25%;height:100%;border:.45cqw solid #999;background:#fff}
.shower{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;width:30%;height:64%;border:.45cqw solid #ccc;background:#f6f6f6}
.sink{position:absolute;left:38%;bottom:3%;width:22%;height:15%;border:.65cqw solid #999}
.sink:after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:16% 20%;border:.55cqw solid #aaa;border-radius:50%}
.wc{position:absolute;right:12%;bottom:3%;width:20%;height:23%;border:.65cqw solid #999;border-radius:48% 48% 2cqw 2cqw}
.entry{position:absolute;bottom:-3.5cqw;left:52.5%;border-left:2.2cqw solid transparent;border-right:2.2cqw solid transparent;border-bottom:2.9cqw solid #314050}
</style>
